Coder Bunnyz:

Problem: It is not always easy to learn logic and problem-solving since teaching programming to children is usually text-heavy and not engaging.

Solution: Coder Bunnys is an interactive educational game that can teach kids coding concepts in a fun way by engaging in challenges and playing the game visually and allows children to think logically and enjoy the process of learning.

Technologies: React native (mobile app), C.NET (backend), MySQL (database), Postman (API testing).
